If you drop coins into a fountain, 50% of the time, the coins will
sink to the bottom of the fountain.

The other 50% of the time, something special happens.

If it is a magic fountain, there is a chance, that increases with more
luck and more gold dropped, that you get a wish.  Whether you get a
wish or not, this action turns the fountain into a regular fountain.

If it is a regular fountain, then some other thing happens, which may
be based on the gold you drop, such as water moccasins appearing.

Doing this will set the fountain as not looted (maybe).

I have begun to code this, if anyone is interested.


